{"id":"estraneo","lemma":"estraneo","pos":"adj","rank":3520,"glosses":["extraneous or foreign (to)","unrelated (to), unconnected (with)"],"ipa":"/esˈtra.ne.o/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/08/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-estraneo.wav/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-estraneo.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"estranea","masculinePlural":"estranei","femininePlural":"estranee"},"examples":[{"text":"Sono ancora un estraneo qui.","en":"I'm still a stranger here.","words":[{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},{"g":"still / again"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Non siamo estranei.","en":"We're not strangers.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null]},{"text":"Mi tratta come se fossi un'estranea.","en":"He treats me as if I were a stranger.","words":[{"g":"me / myself"},{"g":"to treat","l":"trattare"},null,null,{"g":"ditch","l":"fosso"},{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"as if, as though"]]},{"text":"È un perfetto estraneo per me.","en":"He is a complete stranger to me.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"perfect"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Non parlare mai con gli estranei.","en":"Never talk to strangers.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to talk, to speak"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / to him"},null]}]}